and what you see as _pointless_ can be seen as quite _relevant_ depending
on what you WANT...
bottom line, is: you could break any language in zeros and ones, and there
is no **definitive reason to put these units in bigger packs, as human
beings tend to do (we don't think or talk only with 0 and 1).
Off course, you might feel that in general it is less _pointless_ trying to
get closer to such a language (made only of 0 and 1)...


